The distribution and benchmark drivers derive from Enntity/SparkInkling,
SparkQwen and SparkGLM (AGPL-3.0-only). Atlas is licensed under AGPL-3.0-only.
The image build includes CUTLASS and the notices for its Rust dependencies.

Ling-3.2-air weights are published by inclusionAI under MIT. Spark mode uses
Primitive's MIT-licensed Ling-3.2-air-NVFP4A16 derivative. Model files are
downloaded from their respective repositories. Individual upstream code files
retain their original notices.

LingSante-3.1-air-VL and its MXFP4 release are published by inclusionAI.
Enntity publishes the optional NVFP4 derivative of the original inclusionAI BF16 files.
The optional Air-VL draft block comes from Primitive’s Ling-3.2-air-NVFP4A16.

demo/lingsante/data/cxr-lll-pneumonia-effusion-1024.jpg is "Left lower lobe
pneumonia associated with a small left sided pleural effusion" by James
Heilman, MD, licensed under CC BY 3.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/),
via Wikimedia Commons, downscaled to 1,024 pixels wide. The demo's chart, lab
report and patients are synthetic.
